Added `__builtin_expect` hints so the common valid-type path falls through and the profile lookup path stays cold, reducing taken branches in the hot decode loop while preserving exact behavior.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetType() const
{
    if (__builtin_expect(type != FIT_UINT8_INVALID, 1))
        return type;

    if (__builtin_expect(profile != NULL && profileIndex < profile->numFields, 1))
        return profile->fields[profileIndex].type;

    return FIT_UINT8_INVALID;
}
```